ontainer class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;" data-ref="6aefc051-0c07-4084-b87b-32f26b5b73da" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="9c176bdf-0683-48cd-bd50-d3d49350cfba"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="f0b49c14-2860-4c80-b055-4480a0338627"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D451 TEX-I" data-ref="d0979067-9a5a-4e97-baa3-58bc52d5ecee"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="fbd53ccc-9963-4b6f-b97b-abf250e1f744"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="d5c48114-e5a3-4272-9005-5786e1b5164c"><mi data-ref="cec85d4c-24a9-44a0-ab55-58a746496857">d</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> space-separated integers — the keys to be deleted from the B-Tree.</li><li data-ref="86fc8e07-cd14-4202-8529-9f92334ed8cc">The sixth line contains a single integer <mjx-container class="MathJax" jax="CHTML" style="font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;" data-ref="0a8d06bd-d506-41a6-861f-08d790beffe3" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><mjx-math class="MJX-TEX" aria-hidden="true" data-ref="d2d9d9eb-4f48-4caf-8c1d-d693de43f6cd"><mjx-mi class="mjx-i" data-ref="b1bd47d3-05ae-4f52-be05-9f5670e31764"><mjx-c class="mjx-c1D458 TEX-I" data-ref="14f3dd4f-d2f1-45d8-957c-e045e837fe9d"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable="on" display="inline" data-ref="e03aa6c9-da1a-4126-a3eb-5998f50f7f04"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" data-ref="6d526d62-3b28-4706-94d6-dfa9cf869f02"><mi data-ref="623ffd33-a455-4082-acfb-83571a4a57d7">k</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> — the key to be searched in the B-Tree.</li></ul><p data-ref="f871b13e-fc60-4c81-b635-88efbcb3e3ef" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="b72a9a91-bc01-4265-b97b-252f3ffcfdba"></p><p data-ref="34260c33-703e-482f-90a9-31bf021874c5" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="d3053460-cb73-4042-ae90-553420718808">Output Format:</strong></p><ul data-ref="5554a551-5fb4-4b51-8850-9b161ff52ad0" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><li data-ref="5ba1b193-dff1-4a1e-8658-d9366a1a3a0f">The first line of output should display the inorder traversal of the B-Tree after all insertions, with each key separated by a space.</li><li data-ref="dc7975a1-280c-4de0-81ae-822396fc8027">The second line should display the inorder traversal of the B-Tree after all deletions, with each key separated by a space.</li><li data-ref="5f07856f-7adb-423f-bc01-0597617be4bf">The third line should print <strong data-ref="ddb0fa03-5332-41c8-9a93-47cd0feb2da7">Found</strong> if the search key exists in the B-Tree. If the key is not present, print <strong data-ref="5ca984bc-d4db-4b55-92b5-0aa621ef0baa">Not Found</strong> instead.</li></ul><p data-ref="f976638b-c7d2-4478-a276-373192ee8d1a" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="d939c66a-74e4-4845-8785-b5149ecfca7c"></p><p data-ref="aa38a2b0-4caa-475b-b5e6-61fd2f3fa3db" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><br data-ref="d61d2fd1-b3fc-4768-a6f8-69ac262068d0"></p><p data-ref="71131885-745b-4160-9b66-0ff71c3b1d83" data-counter-list-1-reset="0" data-counter-reset="list-1 list-2 list-3 list-4 list-5 list-6 list-7 list-8 list-9" data-counter-list-2-reset="0" data-counter-list-3-reset="0" data-counter-list-4-reset="0" data-counter-list-5-reset="0" data-counter-list-6-reset="0" data-counter-list-7-reset="0" data-counter-list-8-reset="0" data-counter-list-9-reset="0"><strong data-ref="e5e38320-ec80-425a-9c40-b44fcfac6aa8">Note: </strong>Refer to the test cases for better understanding.</p></span></div><div class="mb-3" data-ref="58df3f4f-a8e4-4251-a9fa-fc910e1ef3cb"><div class="ml-1 mb-3" data-ref="1bc83ef7-7f16-4acc-b946-de5cf0b19f0e"><b style="border-bottom:1px solid black;" data-ref="2c75661b-9dea-42cc-be65-d08f62249dfd" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Source Code: </b></div><div class="user-solution" style="page-break-inside: auto" data-ref="d1284c42-c41b-4f7e-af19-ddc4842e96a8" data-undisplayed="undisplayed"><div class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" style="font-family: monospace !important;border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0; border: 1px solid black; break-after: avoid; page-break-after: avoid;" data-ref="26e3f3fe-2d26-41e8-a2ef-220ca62d8ca4" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">Btreemain.c</div> <pre style="overflow: visible; border: 1px solid black; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 4px;" class="px-3 pt-2 pb-1" data-ref="b9223178-1819-4ccd-bbb2-ab822657fd08" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;
#include &lt;stdlib.h&gt;
#include &lt;stdbool.h&gt;

typedef struct BTreeNode {
    int *keys;
    int t;
    struct BTreeNode **c;
    int n;
    bool leaf;
} BTreeNode;

BTreeNode *createnode(int t, bool leaf) {
    BTreeNode *node = (BTreeNode *)malloc(sizeof(BTreeNode));
    node-&gt;t = t;
    node-&gt;leaf = leaf;
    node-&gt;keys = (int *)malloc((2 * t - 1) * sizeof(int));
    node-&gt;c = (BTreeNode **)malloc((2 * t) * sizeof(BTreeNode *));
    node-&gt;n = 0;
    return node;
}

void inorder(BTreeNode *root) {
    if (!root)
        return;

    for (int i = 0; i &lt; root-&gt;n; i++) {
        if (!root-&gt;leaf)
            inorder(root-&gt;c[i]);

        printf("%d ", root-&gt;keys[i]);
    }

    if (!root-&gt;leaf)
        inorder(root-&gt;c[root-&gt;n]);
}

bool search(BTreeNode *root, int k) {
    int i = 0;

    while (i &lt; root-&gt;n &amp;&amp; k &gt; root-&gt;keys[i])
        i++;

    if (i &lt; root-&gt;n &amp;&amp; root-&gt;keys[i] == k)
        return true;

    if (root-&gt;leaf)
        return false;

    return search(root-&gt;c[i], k);
}

void splitchild(BTreeNode *x, int i) {
    int t = x-&gt;t;
    BTreeNode *y = x-&gt;c[i];
    BTreeNode *z = createnode(t, y-&gt;leaf);

    z-&gt;n = t - 1;

    for (int j = 0; j &lt; t - 1; j++)
        z-&gt;keys[j] = y-&gt;keys[j + t];

    if (!y-&gt;leaf) {
        for (int j = 0; j &lt; t; j++)
            z-&gt;c[j] = y-&gt;c[j + t];
    }

    y-&gt;n = t - 1;

    for (int j = x-&gt;n; j &gt;= i + 1; j--)
        x-&gt;c[j + 1] = x-&gt;c[j];

    x-&gt;c[i + 1] = z;

    for (int j = x-&gt;n - 1; j &gt;= i; j--)
        x-&gt;keys[j + 1] = x-&gt;keys[j];

    x-&gt;keys[i] = y-&gt;keys[t - 1];
    x-&gt;n++;
}

void insertNonFull(BTreeNode *x, int k) {
    int i = x-&gt;n - 1;

    if (x-&gt;leaf) {
        while (i &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; k &lt; x-&gt;keys[i]) {
            x-&gt;keys[i + 1] = x-&gt;keys[i];
            i--;
        }

        x-&gt;keys[i + 1] = k;
        x-&gt;n++;
    } else {
        while (i &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; k &lt; x-&gt;keys[i])
            i--;

        i++;

        if (x-&gt;c[i]-&gt;n == 2 * x-&gt;t - 1) {
            splitchild(x, i);

            if (k &gt; x-&gt;keys[i])
                i++;
        }

        insertNonFull(x-&gt;c[i], k);
    }
}

void insert(BTreeNode **rootref, int k) {
    BTreeNode *r = *rootref;

    if (r-&gt;n == 2 * r-&gt;t - 1) {
        BTreeNode *s = createnode(r-&gt;t, false);
        s-&gt;c[0] = r;

        splitchild(s, 0);

        int i = (k &gt; s-&gt;keys[0]) ? 1 : 0;

        insertNonFull(s-&gt;c[i], k);
        *rootref = s;
    } else {
        insertNonFull(r, k);
    }
}

int getPred(BTreeNode *x) {
    while (!x-&gt;leaf)
        x = x-&gt;c[x-&gt;n];

    return x-&gt;keys[x-&gt;n - 1];
}

int getSucc(BTreeNode *x) {
    while (!x-&gt;leaf)
        x = x-&gt;c[0];

    return x-&gt;keys[0];
}

void merge(BTreeNode *x, int idx) {
    BTreeNode *c1 = x-&gt;c[idx];
    BTreeNode *c2 = x-&gt;c[idx + 1];
    int t = x-&gt;t;

    c1-&gt;keys[t - 1] = x-&gt;keys[idx];

    for (int i = 0; i &lt; c2-&gt;n; ++i)
        c1-&gt;keys[i + t] = c2-&gt;keys[i];

    if (!c1-&gt;leaf) {
        for (int i = 0; i &lt;= c2-&gt;n; ++i)
            c1-&gt;c[t + i] = c2-&gt;c[i];
    }

    for (int i = idx + 1; i &lt; x-&gt;n; ++i)
        x-&gt;keys[i - 1] = x-&gt;keys[i];

    for (int i = idx + 2; i &lt;= x-&gt;n; ++i)
        x-&gt;c[i - 1] = x-&gt;c[i];

    c1-&gt;n += c2-&gt;n + 1;
    x-&gt;n--;

    free(c2);
}

void fill(BTreeNode *x, int idx) {
    int t = x-&gt;t;

    if (idx &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; x-&gt;c[idx - 1]-&gt;n &gt;= t) {
        BTreeNode *child = x-&gt;c[idx];
        BTreeNode *sibling = x-&gt;c[idx - 1];

        for (int i = child-&gt;n - 1; i &gt;= 0; --i)
            child-&gt;keys[i + 1] = child-&gt;keys[i];

        if (!child-&gt;leaf) {
            for (int i = child-&gt;n; i &gt;= 0; --i)
                child-&gt;c[i + 1] = child-&gt;c[i];
        }

        child-&gt;keys[0] = x-&gt;keys[idx - 1];

        if (!child-&gt;leaf)
            child-&gt;c[0] = sibling-&gt;c[sibling-&gt;n];

        x-&gt;keys[idx - 1] = sibling-&gt;keys[sibling-&gt;n - 1];

        child-&gt;n += 1;
        sibling-&gt;n -= 1;
    }
    else if (idx &lt; x-&gt;n &amp;&amp; x-&gt;c[idx + 1]-&gt;n &gt;= t) {
        BTreeNode *child = x-&gt;c[idx];
        BTreeNode *sibling = x-&gt;c[idx + 1];

        child-&gt;keys[child-&gt;n] = x-&gt;keys[idx];

        if (!child-&gt;leaf)
            child-&gt;c[child-&gt;n + 1] = sibling-&gt;c[0];

        x-&gt;keys[idx] = sibling-&gt;keys[0];

        for (int i = 1; i &lt; sibling-&gt;n; ++i)
            sibling-&gt;keys[i - 1] = sibling-&gt;keys[i];

        if (!sibling-&gt;leaf) {
            for (int i = 1; i &lt;= sibling-&gt;n; ++i)
                sibling-&gt;c[i - 1] = sibling-&gt;c[i];
        }

        child-&gt;n += 1;
        sibling-&gt;n -= 1;
    }
    else {
        if (idx != x-&gt;n)
            merge(x, idx);
        else
            merge(x, idx - 1);
    }
}

void removeFromNode(BTreeNode *x, int k) {
    int idx = 0;

    while (idx &lt; x-&gt;n &amp;&amp; x-&gt;keys[idx] &lt; k)
        ++idx;

    if (idx &lt; x-&gt;n &amp;&amp; x-&gt;keys[idx] == k) {
        if (x-&gt;leaf) {
            for (int i = idx + 1; i &lt; x-&gt;n; ++i)
                x-&gt;keys[i - 1] = x-&gt;keys[i];

            x-&gt;n--;
        }
        else {
            if (x-&gt;c[idx]-&gt;n &gt;= x-&gt;t) {
                int pred = getPred(x-&gt;c[idx]);
                x-&gt;keys[idx] = pred;
                removeFromNode(x-&gt;c[idx], pred);
            }
            else if (x-&gt;c[idx + 1]-&gt;n &gt;= x-&gt;t) {
                int succ = getSucc(x-&gt;c[idx + 1]);
                x-&gt;keys[idx] = succ;
                removeFromNode(x-&gt;c[idx + 1], succ);
            }
            else {
                merge(x, idx);
                removeFromNode(x-&gt;c[idx], k);
            }
        }
    }
    else {
        if (x-&gt;leaf)
            return;

        bool flag = (idx == x-&gt;n);

        if (x-&gt;c[idx]-&gt;n &lt; x-&gt;t)
            fill(x, idx);

        if (flag &amp;&amp; idx &gt; x-&gt;n)
            removeFromNode(x-&gt;c[idx - 1], k);
        else
            removeFromNode(x-&gt;c[idx], k);
    }
}

void deletekey(BTreeNode **rootref, int k) {
    BTreeNode *r = *rootref;

    removeFromNode(r, k);

    if (r-&gt;n == 0) {
        BTreeNode *tmp = r;

        if (r-&gt;leaf)
            *rootref = NULL;
        else
            *rootref = r-&gt;c[0];

        free(tmp);
    }
}

int main() {
    int t;
    scanf("%d", &amp;t);

    BTreeNode *root = createnode(t, true);

    int n, val;
    scanf("%d", &amp;n);

    for (int i = 0; i &lt; n; i++) {
        scanf("%d", &amp;val);
        insert(&amp;root, val);
    }

    inorder(root);

    int d;
    scanf("%d", &amp;d);

    for (int i = 0; i &lt; d; i++) {
        scanf("%d", &amp;val);
        deletekey(&amp;root, val);
    }

    inorder(root);

    int target;
    scanf("%d\n", &amp;target);

    if (search(root, target))
        printf("Found\n");
    else
        printf("Not Found\n");

    return 0;
}</pre><br data-ref="b6b3ecab-50fb-43d7-b8bb-b5fc678e7e3d"></div></div><div class="row" data-ref="fe4cdbcd-367f-4baf-9a87-206cb275ed20"><div class="col-12" data-ref="068f8af1-234c-4aa2-997e-f20bdb249c86"><h5 class="execResultsHeading text-center" data-ref="2b4d92a3-e2fb-49d1-9d07-70e79e800cd2">Execution Results <span class="executionResultsStatusSpan" style="font-size:0.9rem;" data-ref="cea586ca-b879-450b-9fe0-b77df6567b61" data-undisplayed="undisplayed">- All test cases have succeeded!</span></h5></div></div><div class="mb-4 mx-4" data-ref="319d15eb-52fd-4b64-a60f-ac4449f2d50e"><div class="row execution-results-border" data-ref="54e623ee-b952-4e92-9ec0-dbd47597cf79"><div class="col-12 p-2 text-center font-weight-bold" data-ref="5222b5e5-04b0-46cd-bb6e-ab0f90c6e9d9">Test Case - 1</div></div><div class="row execution-results-border" data-ref="a5c39edc-833d-4bb1-ab6c-c8227031a69e"><div class="col-12 p-1 ml-2 font-weight-bold" data-ref="d4317964-0cae-4b51-b4bb-7d8e1a91f760">User Output</div></div><div class="row execution-results-border" data-ref="671e92f2-4ecb-4c2d-a14a-bd657cb20f26"><div class="col-6" data-ref="6efd73b4-9d19-4ef2-889b-7fa307c8e881"><span class="cmd" title="User Input" data-ref="2fc7005e-085b-4aa0-a642-18fe7c4b2728">2</span></div></div><div class="row execution-results-border" data-ref="a793d905-91c6-4679-ab03-10c34288b38b"><div class="col-6" data-ref="ffb695a9-39cd-466f-bb3b-5115454be1d8"><span class="cmd" title="User Input" data-ref="d7eb46d5-f67e-4356-85b1-0ba4303ce606">7</span></div></div><div class="row execution-results-border" data-ref="01e50603-1b2c-4731-8c96-7bd4d99cf0f8"><div class="col-6" data-ref="bfe06500-1352-41e0-ad62-6b02efffd6c3"><span class="cmd" title="User Input" data-ref="d96336d8-3bb4-4710-9146-ee6b5adfacd6">10 20 5 6 12 30 7</span></div></div><div class="row execution-results-border" data-ref="b0efeb81-c5a2-4d73-ba42-8749944fcdb9"><div class="col-6" data-ref="2f01ebea-2b8e-42f3-a451-13ac7289b2f9"><span class="cmd" title="User In